                                    "patching_rect": [ 10.0, 70.0, 660.0, 53.0 ],
                                    "text": "[evi.ladder.transistor~] and [evi.ladder.diode~] have dedicated inlets for modulation. With direct cutoff modulation you have to be careful of stability and aliasing, especially with the diode filter, but it works. With extreme modulation the sound becomes dominated by the filter rather than the source material.",
