                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 10.0, 70.0, 663.0, 84.0 ],
                                    "text": "In this tab you can compare the sound of the four different Transistor Ladder inspired Filters in the evieve Package (one of them is also called 'transistor', but they are all transistor emulations). All filters are TPT filters. They all have different nonlinear characteristics, resonance behaviours and are actually very different filters, tuned differently for maximum variety of choice. The three 'ladder' filters are traditional 24dB lowpass ladders, whereas the 'lorez' is a 12dB lowpass variant but with powerful resonance.",
